# Core Module

Session conversion, parsing & utilities.

## Files

| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `universal_session.py` | UniversalSession dataclass |
| `converters.py` | Format ↔ Format conversion |
| `session_parser.py` | Auto-detect session format |
| `session_utils.py` | Validation, fingerprint, extract helpers |
| `exceptions.py` | Custom exceptions |

## Usage

```python
from core import (
    UniversalSession, SessionConverter,
    SessionParser, SessionUtils,
)

# 1. Parse any format
s = SessionParser.parse(some_string, api_id=123, api_hash="abc")

# 2. Validate
SessionUtils.validate_session(s)

# 3. Get fingerprint (safe to log)
fp = SessionUtils.auth_key_fingerprint(s.auth_key)

# 4. Convert to all formats
all_fmt = SessionConverter.convert_all(s)
